abstract: "Every tropical zodiac sign ingress of Venus, Mars and Mercury (3,130) and every Moon sign change in the tropical (14,599) and sidereal Lahiri (14,598) zodiacs from 1940 to 2030, in UTC and JST, computed with Astronomy Engine 2.1.19. Includes the generator scripts."
